Experiment: the worker loop of FrankenPHP's docs in public/index.php instead of symfony/runtime's runner.
symfony/runtime is removed, and bin/console bootstraps Symfony itself: as long as the SymfonyRuntime class exists,
FrameworkBundle::boot() leaves registering Symfony's ErrorHandler to symfony/runtime, so a loop that bypasses it
while the package stays installed runs without the ErrorHandler.

